<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Document</title>
    <style>
      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        height: 100%;
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        background-color: #f0f0f0;
      }

      .main {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        width: 100%;
      }
      .assessmetForm {
        padding: 30px 20px;
        max-width: 600px;
      }
      p {
        margin: 20px 0;
        color: #333;
      }
      .user {
        height: 60px;
        width: 60px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .user img {
        height: 100%;
        width: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
      .clientDetails h5 {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      .clientDetails {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 0 20px 0 0;
        margin: 20px 0;
        padding-bottom: 30px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.274);
      }
      .client {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }
      .logo {
        height: 50px;
        width: 50px;
      }
      .logo img {
        height: 100%;
        width: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
      p span {
        font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        p span {
          font-family: "Calibri", sans-serif;
          font-size: 0.85rem;
          line-height: 1.3;
          
        }
        .assessmetForm {
          padding: 15px;
        }
        .logo {
        height: 30px;
        width: 30px;
      }
      .user{
        height: 40px;
        width: 40px;
      }
       
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="main">
      <div class="assessmetForm">
        <p>
          <span> Hi <%= clientName %>, </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span>
            Before we begin the nutritional counseling, I would like you to
            answer a few questions regarding your health, lifestyle and eating
            habits.
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span>
            These answers will be added to your profile so I can better prepare
            your nutritional counseling and understand your goals and needs.
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span
            >Please fill in this  questionnaire  as soon as possible:
            <a href="<%= updateUrl %>" style="text-decoration: none; color: #1142e1"
              ><%= updateUrl %></a
            ></span
          >
        </p>
        <div class="clientDetails">
          <div class="client">
            <div class="user">
              <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dmracr8nw/image/upload/v1737091609/user_madxub.png" />
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.98rem;"><span style="font-weight: 700;font-size: 0.95rem;"> <%= userName %> </span> through Nutrium</p>
          </div>
          <div class="logo">
            <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dmracr8nw/image/upload/v1737092900/nutrium_n3cssb.png" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <p >
          <span 
            >You can reply directly to this message through this email. For a
            better communication experience with your professional, download
            Nutrium mobile app available for
            <a href="#" style="text-decoration: none; color: #1142e1"
              >Android</a
            >
            and <a style="text-decoration: none; color: #1142e1">iOS</a>.</span
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
